---
import { links } from '../data/episode';
---
<section class="signoff" id="signoff">
  <div class="so-inner">
    <div class="recap rv">
      <div class="recap-row">
        <span class="mono recap-num">01</span>
        <p><strong>The foundation.</strong> Twelve years of Marine Corps logistics and recruiting weren&rsquo;t a detour from engineering. They were the training set.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="recap-row">
        <span class="mono recap-num">02</span>
        <p><strong>The build years.</strong> Startup, freelance, and serverless-at-scale each teach a different layer (shipping, scoping, discipline), and doing all three in public compounds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="recap-row">
        <span class="mono recap-num">03</span>
        <p><strong>The mission.</strong> AI doesn&rsquo;t need more engagement machines. It needs local-first tools that hand real capability to people who can&rsquo;t code: software that&rsquo;s helpful, not addictive.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="so-line split" data-split>
      KEEP BUILDING, WHATEVER<br />YOUR <span class="lime">STARTING LINE</span> LOOKED LIKE.
    </h2>

    <div class="complete-note mono" id="complete-note" hidden>
      &#9619; FULL STORY UNCOVERED &middot; 11/11 ANSWERED. NICELY DONE.
    </div>

    <nav class="so-links mono rv" aria-label="Elsewhere">
      {links.map((l) => (
        <a href={l.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor="VISIT">
          <span class="so-label">&gt; {l.label}</span>
          <span class="so-note">{l.note}</span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </nav>

    <footer class="so-foot mono">
      <span>FROM CRAYONS TO CODE</span>
      <span class="barcode" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>&copy; ANDREW ROBIDA &middot; HELPFUL, NOT ADDICTIVE</span>
    </footer>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .signoff {
    background: var(--crt);
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--dim) 25%, transparent);
    padding: 7rem 1.5rem 3rem;
  }
  .so-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .recap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; margin-bottom: 5rem; border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--dim) 30%, transparent); }
  .recap-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 1.6rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--dim) 30%, transparent);
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .recap-num { color: var(--hazard); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .recap-row p { color: var(--dim); max-width: 70ch; line-height: 1.7; }
  .recap-row strong { color: var(--phosphor); font-weight: 600; }

  .so-line {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6.5vw, 5.2rem);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .complete-note[hidden] { display: none; }
  .complete-note {
    color: var(--void);
    background: var(--hazard);
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .so-links {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--dim) 35%, transparent);
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  .so-links a {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 0 solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--dim) 25%, transparent);
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .so-links a:nth-child(odd) { border-right-width: 1px; }
  .so-links a:nth-child(-n+2) { border-bottom-width: 1px; }
  .so-links a:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--hazard) 8%, transparent); }
  .so-label { color: var(--hazard); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .so-note { color: var(--dim); font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

  .so-foot {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--dim) 25%, transparent);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  /* fake barcode: layered repeating bars with offset periods */
  .barcode {
    width: 96px;
    height: 22px;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--dim) 0 1px, transparent 1px 4px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--dim) 0 2px, transparent 2px 9px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--dim) 0 3px, transparent 3px 13px);
    background-blend-mode: lighten;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .recap-row { grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .so-links { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .so-links a:nth-child(odd) { border-right-width: 0; }
    .so-links a:nth-child(-n+3) { border-bottom-width: 1px; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('episode-complete', () => {
    const note = document.getElementById('complete-note');
    if (note) note.hidden = false;
  });
</script>
